    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi naasingura Abamaleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya kasatu, Daudi n'abasaija be eki baahikiireho Zikiraga, Abamaleki bakaba bamazire kuseesira Negebbu na Zikiraga. Zikiraga bagisingwire kandi bagyokeze n'omurro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "banyagire abakazi na boona abakaba barumu, abato n'abakuru; bataine muntu noomu, baitu bakabanyaga baabatwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi n'abasaija be obubaahikire omurubuga, bakasanga orubuga ruhiire, bakazi baabu, batabani baabu na bahara baabu banyagirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi n'abo abakaaba ainabo, baateera ekyoboobo, baarra okuhika amaani obugaabahoire, baalemwa n'ag'okwongera kurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.25.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 25:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.25.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baka Daudi ababiri: Ahinohamu owa Yezereeri, n'Abigairi muko mubule Nabbali owa Karumeeri, nuho bagenderaine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaba omu mwetunturo ogutagambwa; habwokuba abantu be boona habw'okufeerwa batabani baabu na bahara baabu, bakaba nibasaalirwa muno, nukwo kugamba kumuteera amabaale; baitu MUKAMA Ruhanga we yamugumya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.20+1SA.22.21+1SA.22.22+1SA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22:20-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaragira Abyasara nyakatagara mutabani wa Ahimereki ati: “Ndeetera efodi” egi, Abyasara yagimuleetera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nubwo yayekagwize hali MUKAMA ati: “Abaseesi abo mbahondere? Ndabakwata?” MUKAMA yamugarukamu ati: “Bahondere noija kubakwata kandi abanyagwa obanagise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nukwo kwimukya hamu n'abasaija be rukaaga abaakaba ainabo, baahika hakasaaru Besora, abamu hali bo, abo nubo baasigaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yairrayo, aina abasaija ebikumi bbina; ebikumi bibiri abakaba bajwaahire muno batarukusobora kwambuka akasaaru Besora, baasigara enyuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija abaikaraga na Daudi, bakasanga Omunyamisiri ali omubwerre, baamumuleetera; baamuha ebyokulya yalya, baamuha n'amaizi g'okunywa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baamuteeraho n'ekitonge eky'ebijuma by'emitini, n'empagara ibiri ez'emizabbibbu. Obuyamazire kulya yagarukwamu amaani; habwokuba akaba amazire ebiro bisatu musana n'ekiro ataliire by'okulya kandi atanywire maizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Daudi yamukaguza ati: “Oli muntu w'oha, kandi nooruga ha?” Oli yagarukamu ati: “Nyowe ndi musigazi Munyamisiri, ndi muheereza w'Omumaleeki; mukama wange akansiga habwokuba nkarwara, hati hahingwireho ebiro bisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukaba tuseesiire Negebbu ey'Abakeresi, eya Yuda, na Negebbu eya Kalebbu; Zikiraga twagyokya n'omurro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yamukaguza ati: “Abaseesi aboosobora kubampikyaho?” Omusigazi yagarukamu ati: “Ndahira noojurra Ruhanga, nkooku otanyite, kandi nkooku otante omumikono ya mukama wange, nukwo mbakuhikyeho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusigazi nambere yahikiizeeyo Daudi, bakasanga bamoomere ensi yoona, bali omukulya n'okunywa, nibazina habw'eminyago enyingi ei bakaba banyagire omu nsi ey'Abafirisiti n'eya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yabaita okuruga obwire nibukwata amaiso okuhika omurwiririzi orw'ekiro ekyakurasireho; okwihaho abasigazi ebikumi bbina abaatembere engamiya bairuka, busaho noomu ayatabukire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Byona Abamaleki ebibakaba banyagire akabigarra hamu n'abakazi be ababiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Byona ebikaba binyagirwe busaho ekyasigaireyo, ekitoito n'ekikooto, abaana aboojo n'abaisiki. Buli kintu ekikaba kinyagirwe, byona akabigarra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yanyaga namagana goona ag'embuzi n'ag'enimi; abasaija be baagafunya, uwe naabahondera, nibagamba bati: “Ogu nugwo munyago gwa Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Daudi yahikaho abasaija bali ebikumi bibiri, abaajwahire muno, baalemwa ag'okumuhondera, baasigara ha kasaaru Besora; abasaija baija kutangaana Daudi, n'abaakaba ainabo. Daudi obuyabahikireho, yabaramukya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija abamu ababi kandi abataina ngeso abakaba bagenzire na Daudi, nubwo baagambire bati: “Abo batagende na itwe, habwaki babagana ha munyago ogu tuleesire, titurukwija kubahaho; buli musaija atwale mukazi we n'abaana; bagende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yagarukamu ati, “Bagenzi bange, eki mutakisura, mumazire kurora byona MUKAMA ebyatukoliire! Akatulinda, abaseesi abo abaatuseesiire, yatuha kubasingura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekimurukugamba, busaho noomu asobora kukiikiriza. Abantu boona basemeriire kwinganaingana: ogu ayagiire ha bulemu omugabo ogu araatunga, noogu ayasigaire naalinda ebintu, na uwe nugwo aratunga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga ha kiro eki, eki yakifoora kiragiro mali, ekikyaroho omu Isirairi, okuhika na hati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
